  WrittenDialogue: "Is it true that you’re trying to use the government for your own financial interest with your non-profit?\nUhhh that’s not true at all. It’s in the language. Non-Profit?  Helping Hands getting a boost has no benefit in my life.\nBy the way after this rally I’ll be traveling to Luxemburg to help their growing homeless crisis."
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KAREN\nKELLY\nKELLY"
